WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Repeated stress can initiate fatigue damage even when a single load is below a one-time strength limit. Cycles and material details matter.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
A component seeing 10,000 moderate cycles is a different case from one seeing a single static load; actual life needs tested data.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Failure case diagnosis

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
This ideal mechanism leaves out friction, temperature and part-specific behavior. Real designs need measurements.

